st, us-west and eu-west, replacing v2.3.1. Because v2.3.2 had never run in production, policy required change-manager approval. The deploy went to the approver first, and they approved it (\"Looks right\").\n\n**Health after deploy:** The service reports healthy. The error rate dropped from 0.18 on v2.3.1 to 0.002.\n\n**Incident:** I opened INC-0001 (SEV3, checkout-api) recording the change, which paged on-call. It notes the approval and that v2.3.0 is the last healthy version to roll back to if needed.", "type": "text"}]}]}